message: If you use this software, please cite the paper below.
title: "wmmon: components-of-variance control charts for compositional classifier output"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a components-of-variance control chart for the
  predicted-class composition of a deployed classifier, together with the
  experiment scripts reproducing every result in the accompanying paper.
